  "nameEn": "Winding Stairs",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Climb 7 steps by jumping. When you cannot jump — try turning right, and if you cannot jump there either — turn the robot left. Light the lamps.",
  "descriptionEn": "Stone stairs climb up and wind right and left. A jump overcomes a step, and the sensor tells you when there is no way ahead.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Climb 7 steps by jumping. When you cannot jump — try turning right, and if you cannot jump there either — turn the robot left. Turn off the lamps."
}
